{
  "_id": "Siqw3Bho629rWLEq",
  "name": "Elminster's Effulgent Spheres",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/orb-swirling-teal.webp",
  "folder": "JEGq6BdHmxTqhVEU",
  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Six chromatic spheres orbit you for the duration. While they are present, you can expend them to create the following effects. The spell ends early once no spheres remain.</p><p><strong>Absorb Energy.</strong> When you take Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage, you can take a Reaction to expend one sphere and give yourself Resistance to the triggering damage type until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Energy Blast.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you send one sphere hurtling toward a target within 120 feet of yourself. Make a ranged spell attack; on a hit, the target takes 3d6 Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage (your choice). Hit or miss, the sphere is expended.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The number of spheres increases by 1 for each spell slot level above 6.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-YhnqxyDqK6je4bWz\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Count the spheres by hand; give yourself the Resistance of Absorb Energy by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
